It took me much of my senior year to read the whole book, but I couldn't stop reading it.
The detailed portrayal of characters and emotional arcs leaves readers in awe; even minor characters like Yuqian, Huangshanyan, and Su Mo’ngou have devoted fans. Characters that were not central to the story, such as Jiang Bopao and Chu Yunxiu, also find themselves popular among readers. In an e-sports novel, there is no character so disliked that it can be found throughout the entire work – this is a testament to the success of full-time’s character development.
And on the emotional front, full-time has no of course problems with the afterglow girls in general web novels that have been criticized for being either beautiful or perverted; all the characters’ emotions share one common feature – they like Glory and most want to win honorably.
Small measures have no great conspiracy; everyone looks so simple and adorable.
